OL,3,ACarney says US trade war 'will come at
OL,4,Aa cost' as Canada strikes back on
OL,5,Atariffs
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Mark Carney said that
OL,8,FCanada's pivot away from the US as its
OL,9,Flargest trading partner "will come at a
OL,10,Fcost", as a wave of Canadian
OL,11,Fretaliatory tariffs on American goods
OL,12,Fcome into force.
OL,14,FIn a video address, Carney added that
OL,15,Fthe counter-tariffs against the US "are
OL,16,Fnecessary to protect our workers".
OL,18,FCanada's levies will apply to nearly
OL,19,FC$28bn ($20bn; #15bn) of American
OL,20,Fproducts, from steel to furniture to
OL,21,Fcotton T-shirts, and will be as high as
OL,22,F50%.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
