OL,3,ACarney says US trade war 'will come at
OL,4,Aa cost' as Canada strikes back on
OL,5,Atariffs
OL,6,
OL,7,FBoth US and Canadian officials have
OL,8,Fsaid they would like to strike a deal,
OL,9,Fbut no new talks have been scheduled
OL,10,Fsince negotiations collapsed in late
OL,11,FAugust.
